    feat(node-local-persistent-volume): LvmVolumePoolProbe and LvmVolumeBacking against the real pool
    
    The probe reports each pool failure with its typed detail. ensure reserves the
    exact size, activates the volume and is idempotent. The adapter owns the 30 s
    command deadline and never kills a stalled lvm. claim_state reads the kernel's
    O_EXCL claim as Held, Free or NotFound.
    
